      "body": "Aditya Himmat Bhansali entered into Share Purchase Agreement to acquire 72.70% stake in P.H. Capital Limited (BSE:500143) from a group of sellers for INR 450 million on December 20, 2025. A cash consideration of INR 450.77 million valued at INR 206.66 per share will be paid by the buyer. As part of consideration, INR 450.77 million is paid towards common equity of P.H. Capital Limited. In a related transaction Aditya Himmat Bhansal proposed to acquire 26% stake in P.H. Capital Limited (BSE:500143) for approximately INR 160 million on December 20, 2025. \r\n\r\nThe transaction is subject to approval by regulatory board / committee and subject to statutory approval.",
